  "id": 12,
  "title": "成都大运会主场馆凤凰山体育馆三维可视化管理平台，BIM运维与IBMS的有机结合",
  "date": "2022-03-14",
  "summary": "",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-12.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-3-14/20223141443252272.jpg",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<section style=\"line-height:2;letter-spacing:2px;padding:0px 8px;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;font-size:16px;\"><section style=\"text-align:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><br /></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-3-14/20223141443255060.jpg\" alt=\"1955f2c951b2f6cb0405bffbc53701ea\" title=\"1955f2c951b2f6cb0405bffbc53701ea\" /><br /></p></section><section style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a0a0a0;text-align:right;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">▲图源网络</p></section><section style=\"padding:0px 4px;line-height:1.7;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">刚过去的十三届全国人大五次会议政府工作报告中，<span style=\"color:#0391e3;box-sizing:border-box;\">“数字化”</span>成为高频词，<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">折射出国家对产业数字化转型的高度重视</span>，体现了国家对大力发展智慧城市、智慧建筑的决心。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">古河云科技积极响应时代的号召，肩负着为产业数字化转型升级的时代使命，致力于为企业提供优质数字化转型升级解决方案。针对数字应用新业态，公司倾力打造的<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">智慧综合运维集成管理平台</span>，实现了对不同应用场景管理的<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">全业务覆盖、全层级贯穿、全流程闭环、全智慧升级</span>，为体育场馆、产业园区、轨道交通、教育医疗等不同行业的客户提供智慧化转型升级服务。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p></section><section style=\"text-align:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-3-14/20223141443252272.jpg\" alt=\"1a67edeef4ed48f9ecbbc3615924a1f1\" title=\"1a67edeef4ed48f9ecbbc3615924a1f1\" /><br /></section><section style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a0a0a0;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align:right;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">▲图源网络</p></section><section style=\"padding:0px 4px;line-height:1.7;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">其中，为<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">成都大运会主场馆凤凰山体育馆</span>打造的可视化管理平台作为古河云科技的标杆案例，是公司强大综合技术能力的完美展现。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">凤凰山体育馆位于金牛区的凤凰山体育公园，是成都市“三城三都”重点市政工程项目，场馆部分总建筑面积超<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">45万㎡</span>，是能够容纳超<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">7.8万人</span>的高端综合体育馆，设计之初便是为了承接国内外高规格演出赛事。</p></section><section style=\"text-align:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><br /><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-3-14/20223141449427121.jpg\" title=\"640\" alt=\"640\" /><br /><br /></section><section style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a0a0a0;text-align:right;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">▲图源网络</p></section><section style=\"padding:0px 4px;line-height:1.7;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">前期古河云在经过实地调研并和业主方经过多次沟通后发现该项目需求痛点集中体现在<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">体育馆面积大，建筑结构复杂难以掌握、客户各子系统无法协同运维、应急处置，设备分散无法快速联动、设备众多，难以统一管理等方面。</span></p></section><section style=\"text-align:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-3-14/20223141450126939.jpg\" alt=\"统一告警信息\" title=\"统一告警信息\" /><br /><br /></section><section style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a0a0a0;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">▲演示demo</p></section><section style=\"padding:0px 4px;line-height:1.7;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">围绕着业主方的需求痛点，最终打造出<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">凤凰山体育馆可视化运维管理平台</span>，该平台基于数字孪生技术将场馆建筑结构、各设施设备位置布局完整、精准地还原在体育馆虚拟仿真空间模型上，全新的数字化体验方式能够充分展示凤凰山体育馆综合能力，<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">告别传统复杂的二维建筑结构图纸</span>，通过三维仿真模型实现可视化管理，<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">对内提高运营运维效率，对外提升场馆形象。</span></p></section><section style=\"text-align:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-3-14/20223141443271919.png\" alt=\"图片1\" title=\"图片1\" /><br /><br /><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-3-14/20223141443283263.png\" alt=\"图片2\" title=\"图片2\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a0a0a0;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">▲实拍与demo效果对比图</p></section><section style=\"padding:0px 4px;line-height:1.7;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">基于古河云自研的<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">“开河”智慧云架构支撑平台</span>，将各个建筑设备运行状态完整记录，对能耗进行综合分析管理，实现能耗的有效管控，可<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">提供设备全生命周期的预测能力</span>，辅助于设备的业务管理，实现将设备维修记录、巡检记录、维保记录、告警信息以及操作历史等<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">信息统一集成</span>在凤凰山体育馆可视化运维管理平台上。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p></section><section style=\"text-align:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-3-14/20223141450116064.jpg\" alt=\"场馆运行管理\" title=\"场馆运行管理\" /><br /><br /></section><section style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a0a0a0;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">▲demo演示</p></section><section style=\"padding:0px 4px;line-height:1.7;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">同时，为解决各智能系统孤岛化的问题，消息中心，告警状态，实现应急事件统一调度指挥，并利用各类通信方式，保证报警信息依照权限准确同步送达，实现跨子系统的多设备报警及联动，<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">构建一个强大的智慧“大脑”，</span>做到<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">实时、动态、可视</span>的对凤凰山体育馆内的建筑设备集中运维管理，形成<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">宏观把控、微观可视</span>，全方位覆盖的运维管理模式，极大地提高场馆运维管理效率。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p></section><section style=\"text-align:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-3-14/2022314145098607.jpg\" alt=\"场馆能耗管理\" title=\"场馆能耗管理\" /><br /><br /></section><section style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a0a0a0;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">▲demo演示</p></section><section style=\"padding:0px 4px;line-height:1.7;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">古河云三维可视化运维管理平台</span>，是公司多年来，专注于大数据、物联网、数字孪生等技术领域发展与演进，经过五年技术沉淀与项目积累，同时深入调研客户痛点，针对客户需求，形成的智慧结晶。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">本次项目帮助客户降低能源消耗约15%；设备运行效率提升约20%；设备生命周期延长约20%；运维人员减少约60%，<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">直接实现经济效益年均超百万</span>。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">未来古河云科技将持续发挥自身技术优势，关注并实践技术的创新与升级，为智慧建筑的建设、数字经济的发展注入新的动能。</p></section><section style=\"text-align:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-3-14/20223141452208934.jpg\" title=\"640\" alt=\"640\" /><br /></section></section><p><br /></p>",
